  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Flowing Red Scale</em></p>\n<p>The power of the Flowing Red Scale has reached new heights. As a bonus action for 6 CE or while Flowing Red Scale is active for 3 CE, you instead gain the following benefits for 1 minute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your movement speed is tripled  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain a +4 bonus to AC  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on Dexterity and Strength saving throws and Strength checks and once per round you can reroll a check or save  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain one extra action and reaction.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
